  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19 pandemic surveillance support - DHIS2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency response by UiO and the international HISP network to assist counries to implement a DHIS2 based comprehensive disase surveillance package for enhancing surveillance, case finding and contact tracing of the covid-19 pandemic (with focus on low and middle income countries)</narrative>
  </description>
